OpenHABCore/Package.resolved

# Xcode's own implicit workspace for openHAB.xcodeproj (created when the .xcodeproj is opened
# directly instead of openHAB.xcworkspace). Its Package.resolved drifts from the real one at
# openHAB.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved and, left committed, silently pins
# stale dependency versions (it caused openHAB.app to reintroduce the Firebase 12.6.0 FCM-token
# bug #1334 fixed, since #1334's version bump only touched the real workspace's lockfile) for
# anyone whose Xcode happens to resolve against it.
openHAB.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved

